    "description": "Multiple-choice test of safety knowledge in Chinese and English. It has 11,435 questions per language across seven categories: Offensiveness, Unfairness and Bias, Physical Health, Mental Health, Illegal Activities, Ethics and Morality, and Privacy and Property. A Chinese subset of 2,100 questions removes highly sensitive keywords. Reports give accuracy per category and on average, zero-shot or five-shot. The test answers became public on 2025-07-28.",
